{
  "asked": "Did the venue reply to my email?",
  "said": "I can check, once I can see your mail.",
  "why": "Asking to connect: what it would let me do, then one button. What it can do is not what it is allowed: the connection asks the person for that, and nothing is said to be connected until it is. \"drawn\" is the surface the app is sent.",
  "messages": [
